        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jared Harris, Amber Heard, Mamie Gummer, Danielle Panabaker, Laura-Leigh\n- Works: The Ward, Mad Men, Fringe, The Crown, The Expanse, We're the Millers, The Client List, In Which We Meet Mr. Jones\n- Roles: Lane Pryce, David Robert Jones, King George VI, Anderson Dawes\n- Organizations: AMC, Fox, Netflix, Syfy, FBI\n- Places: Frankfurt\n\nFacts:\n- Jared Francis Harris was born on 24 August 1961 and is an English actor.\n- Jared Harris is known for playing Lane Pryce on AMC's drama series Mad Men.\n- Jared Harris is known for playing David Robert Jones on Fox's science-fiction series Fringe.\n- Jared Harris is known for playing King George VI in Netflix's historical series The Crown.\n- Jared Harris is known for playing Anderson Dawes on Syfy's science-fiction series The Expanse.\n- The film The Ward stars Amber Heard, Mamie Gummer, Danielle Panabaker, and Jared Harris.\n- Laura-Leigh is known for roles in We're the Millers and The Ward, and for being a series regular on The Client List.\n- In the Fringe episode In Which We Meet Mr. Jones, an FBI agent collapses because a parasite constricts his heart.\n- In In Which We Meet Mr. Jones, Olivia must meet biochemist David Robert Jones, played by Jared Harris, in Frankfurt to find a cure.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
